<!--
  PLACEHOLDER. This is NOT HHMI Janelia FlyEM hemibrain data.
  A hand-written 3-neuron ring (A -> B -> C -> A) in the project-local
  format read by com.fruitfly.brain.ConnectomeLoader. The real hemibrain
  bulk export is CSV (neurons / connections tables) and would need a
  separate CSV loader or a conversion step to this format.
